          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "PWM/servo driver | FCCPeripherals | NXP PCA9685PW (I2C 16-ch PWM), I2C addr 0x40"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The PWM driver is addressed at 0x41 instead of the specified 0x40. If the firmware expects the specified address, it will not communicate with the servo/PWM driver, changing the board's behavior from the intended design.",
      "confidence": 0.58
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic shows the PCA9685 PWM driver strapped to I2C address 0x41, whereas the specification states the intended address is 0x40; this address-strapping deviation is the main anomaly."
}

